{"id":"leute","lemma":"Leute","pos":"noun","rank":119,"glosses":["people (several individual persons, a group of people in general, esp. of one kind or another), folk (folks), peeps (slang), guys (boys and/or girls)"],"ipa":"/ˈlɔɪ.tə/ [ˈlɔe̠.t(ʰ)ə]","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/27/De-at-Leute.ogg/De-at-Leute.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wo sind deine Leute?","en":"Where are your people?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757301","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null]},{"text":"Ich mag die Leute hier.","en":"I like the people here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798104","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Warum sagen die Leute das?","en":"Why do people say that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700401","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"the / that"}]},{"text":"Wie viele Leute sind da?","en":"How many people are there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761698","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Ich hasse Leute wie dich.","en":"I hate people like you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756731","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate","l":"hassen"},null,{"g":"how"},{"g":"you","l":"du"}]}]}